            "North America",
            "South America"
          ],
          "subspeciesCount": 3,
          "description": "The northern jacana or northern jaçana (Jacana spinosa) is a wader which is known as a resident breeder from coastal Mexico to western Panama, and on Cuba, Jamaica and Hispaniola in the Caribbean.",
